+/*
+ * Shut Down and restart (SweetPlatformExpert::haltRestart -> viva_halt_restart). Reached from reboot(2) ->
+ * host_reboot -> halt_all_cpus -> PEHaltRestart after the PM shutdown notifications: a thread, interrupts on,
